
# HealthConnect Clinic – Week 7 Data Analytics

## Project Overview

**HealthConnect Clinic** is a synthetic healthcare appointment analytics project developed as part of the **AnalystLab Africa Experience Lab Internship Programme**.

The project explores missed patient appointments and uses data analytics to identify patterns associated with appointment no-shows. The analysis is designed to support better appointment management, patient engagement and healthcare service planning.

Week 7 focused on **testing, validation and refinement** of the analytical work developed in the previous weeks.

---

## Project Question

**How can HealthConnect Clinic use data and AI to reduce missed appointments and improve the patient support experience?**

---

